{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"079caa65ea34b900","name":"card_event_underground_state","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Poland/events/card_event_underground_state","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"UNDERGROUND STATE","text":"Target enemy unit Retreats. Add a LEGIONS to your support line.","flavorText":"The Polish Underground State (Polish: Polskie Państwo Podziemne), also known as the Polish Secret State, was an organization that was built in secrecy in Poland during the Soviet and German occupation. The organization started to form in 1939, a few days before Poland surrendered, and was under the command of General Michal Tokarzewski-Karaszewicz. It was a complex organization, with its own administration, judiciary system, media, educational facilities, its own army and it worked closely together with the Polish Government in Exile. The main goal of the organization was to fight the occupation and to reestablish the Polish state through any means possible, such as armed resistance, sabotage, espionage, propaganda etc. Ultimately hundreds of thousands of people were directly involved with various agencies of the Underground State.","faction":"Poland","type":"order","rarity":"Uncommon","cost":4,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_event_underground_state","title":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_event_underground_state_title","SourceString":"UNDERGROUND STATE","LocalizedString":"UNDERGROUND STATE"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::order","faction":"EFactionEnum::Poland","kredits":4,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_event_underground_state_text","SourceString":"Target enemy unit Retreats. Add a LEGIONS to your support line.","LocalizedString":"Target enemy unit Retreats. Add a LEGIONS to your support line."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_event_underground_state_history","SourceString":"The Polish Underground State (Polish: Polskie Państwo Podziemne), also know